==English==
{{slim-wikipedia|Stripper (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
{{suffix|strip|er|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪpə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who removes their [[clothing]] in a sexually provocative manner, especially as a form of paid [[entertainment]].
# A [[chemical]] or [[tool]] used to remove [[paint]], [[sheathing]], etc. from something.
# A tool used to [[strip]] [[tubing]]: to [[empty]] it by applying [[pressure]] to the outside of the tubing and moving that pressure along the tubing.
# A [[cow]] that has nearly stopped giving [[milk]], so that it can be obtained from her only by [[strip]]ping.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|dancer}} [[ecdysiast]], [[exotic dancer]], [[peeler]]

